  description: 'V5 (visual prefabs): 0:00, no weapons, a quiet sea: the ordinary
    and specialist enemies around the ship (shark, cannonboat, manta ray, swordfish,
    bomb boat, hammerhead, rammer raft, treasure raider, deckhand dinghy, cutthroat
    skiff, gunner cog, boarding barge, drowned pursuer, drowned harrier): their models,
    spawn, wakes, telegraphs and shots. Every visual is a prefab under Assets/_Game/V4/Visuals/Prefabs/<Category>/<id>/
    (plan/v5/VISUAL-PREFABS.md): edit one, then load this again from the Tuning Console.'
